Package: zcf
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10)
Recommends: wine64, qemu-user, strace
Suggests: box64, waydroid
Description: Universal Application Compatibility Fabric and Runtime Orchestrator
 ZCF is an open-source, distribution-independent application compatibility platform.
 It coordinates runtime technologies (Wine, Proton, QEMU, Box64), diagnoses application
 execution failures, and shares compatibility profiles across Linux distributions.
